msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:245
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show the high score tables."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:249
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Game</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Start Tutorial</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:252
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Start the tutorial of the game. This is a user friendly way to learn the "
"game rules."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:256
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Game</guimenu> <guimenuitem>New Sandbox Game</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:259
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In this mode, the solution is displayed at the start of the game. This is "
"useful to understand the game principles."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:264
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Q</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Game</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Quit</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:273
#, no-c-format
msgid "This closes the window and quits &kblackbox;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:281
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <guimenu>Move</guimenu> Menu"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:286
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Game</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Solve</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:292
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use it to give up a game. It shows you the solution: the right positions of "
"the balls."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:297
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Game</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Done!</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:299
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you placed all the balls, choose \"Done!\" to terminate the current "
"game, to compute the final score and to display the real positions of the "
"balls."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:308
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> Menu"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:309
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Not: we discribe here only the menu items that are game specific and skip "
"&kde; standard menu items."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:312
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Difficulty</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:317
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select the game difficulty. Harder games have more balls and bigger black "
"box than easier games. You can also play with a custom difficulty level that "
"you can set up in the setting dialog of &kblackbox;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:318
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Note: games with 4 balls or less can always be solved with certainty! That "
"is not the case for games with 5 balls or more."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:323
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure &kblackbox;...</"
"guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:327
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In this dialog, you can customize the number of balls, columns and rows of "
"the black box in the custom difficulty level."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:335
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <guimenuitem>Help</guimenuitem> Menu"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: sect1
#: index.docbook:335
#, no-c-format
msgid "&help.menu.documentation;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:340
#, no-c-format
msgid "Frequently asked questions"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:345
#, no-c-format
msgid "Who made this game?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:346
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The kdegames team. You can find their website <ulink url=\"http://games.kde."
"org\">here</ulink>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:349
#, no-c-format
msgid "Where can I get cheatcodes?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:350
#, no-c-format
msgid "You cannot get cheatcodes for &kde; games."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:353
#, no-c-format
msgid "How do I start a new game?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:354
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kblackbox; loads directly into the game mode. So you can start playing "
"right away."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:357
#, no-c-format
msgid "How do I pause the game?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:358
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To pause &kblackbox; you can use <menuchoice> <shortcut><keycap>P</keycap></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Game</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Pause</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> on the menubar."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:364
#, no-c-format
msgid "I want to change the way this game looks. Can I?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:365
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kblackbox; does not allow for theme changes at this time."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:368
#, no-c-format
msgid "I have made a mistake. Can I undo?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:369
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kblackbox; has no undo feature. Instead, the second &LMB; click on the ball "
"will remove it from the game board. Also, you can drag and drop the balls "
"instead of removing them."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:372
#, no-c-format
msgid "Can I use keyboard?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:373
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Yes. You can use the directional keys to control the cursor, &Enter; to "
"place and remove balls, and <keycap>Spacebar</keycap> to place 'empty' marks."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:376
#, no-c-format
msgid "I cannot figure out what to do here! Are there hints?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:377
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kblackbox; does not have a Hint feature. However, it features a tutorial "
"mode. To access the tutorial mode use <menuchoice> <guimenu>Game</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Start Tutorial</guimenuitem></menuchoice> on the menubar."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:382
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"I have to quit the game now, but I am not finished yet. Can I save my "
"progress?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:383
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kblackbox; has no save feature at the moment."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:386
#, no-c-format
msgid "Where are the high scores?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:387
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To access the high scores dialog use <menuchoice> <shortcut> <keycombo "
"action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>H</keycap></keycombo> </shortcut> "
"<guimenu>Game</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Show High Scores...</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> on the menubar."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:395
#, no-c-format
msgid "I want to change the game configuration. Where do I go?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:396
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To access the &kblackbox; configuration dialog use <menuchoice> "
"<guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure &kblackbox;...</"
"guimenuitem> </menuchoice> on the menubar."
msgstr ""

